        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we believe our cryogenic systems, advanced informatics, temperature-controlled logistics solutions, critical bioservices and cryopreservation services offerings and global networked operational capabilities, that we are well positioned to continue to benefit from these industry trends.",
