        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also apply engineering resources to product development within our cryogenic systems manufacturing operations, supporting the design, validation, and continuous improvement of cryogenic freezers, dewars, and transport systems.",
