        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Collectively, these engineering and development initiatives are intended to strengthen the reliability, traceability, and efficiency of our solutions as we support the expanding global CGT Market and other parts of the Life Sciences.",
